  "distance_km": 0.7,
  "description": "This walk visits Inchiquin Lough in County Clare. The scenic lake is located near the settlements of Ennis, Corofin and Killinaboy. On the southern side of the lough you'll find a parking area right next to the lakeshore. There's a short footpath here where you can enjoy a peaceful stroll along the lake with some fine views across the water.To continue your walking in the region try theEnnis River Fergus Walk.",
